# characterization baseline: 20-exception-strands-frame-with-claim-token
# An unresolvable site timezone throws mid-frame. The rollback discards every write including the status change, leaving the row holding its claim token forever: not new, not done, not bad (known issue 5).
# documents: docs/known-issues.md#5-stranded-frames-are-unrecoverable-without-manual-sql
#
# Masked values: <CLOCK> clock-derived datetime, <TOKEN> in-flight
# claim token, [PID] worker process id.

